      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argyle%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office has been operating in Argyle since 1882, serving as a longstanding hub for residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
